{"term": {"label": "心", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "6A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gaozi-i", "title": "告子上", "description": "告子曰：「性，猶杞柳也；義，猶桮棬也。以人性為仁義，猶以杞柳為桮棬。」\n孟子曰：「子能順杞柳之性而以為桮棬乎？將戕賊杞柳而後以為桮棬也？如將戕賊杞柳而以為桮棬，則亦將戕賊人以為仁義與？率天下之人而禍仁義者，必子之言夫！」\n告子曰：「性猶湍水也，決諸東方則東流，決諸西方則西流。人性之無分於善不善也，猶水之無分於東西也。」", "occurrences": 28, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "口", "id": "口"}, {"form": "同然", "id": "同然"}, {"form": "外", "id": "外"}, {"form": "失", "id": "失"}, {"form": "學", "id": "學"}, {"form": "心", "variants": [], "id": "心"}, {"form": "志", "id": "志"}, {"form": "思", "id": "思"}, {"form": "悅", "id": "悅"}, {"form": "放", "id": "放"}, {"form": "智", "id": "智"}, {"form": "求", "id": "求"}, {"form": "目", "id": "目"}, {"form": "知", "id": "知"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "至", "id": "至"}, {"form": "貴", "id": "貴"}, {"form": "長", "id": "長"}], "edges": [{"weight": 0.34513029936432754, "source": "心", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 0.48489224173948625, "source": "心", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.24850346367525575, "source": "心", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 0.9957178655054768, "source": "心", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 1.4011829736136412, "source": "心", "target": "智"}, {"weight": 0.9957178655054768, "source": "心", "target": "至"}, {"weight": 2.0943301541735866, "source": "心", "target": "同然"}, {"weight": 0.14842000511827322, "source": "心", "target": "口"}, {"weight": 1.4011829736136412, "source": "心", "target": "悅"}, {"weight": 1.8711866028593769, "source": "心", "target": "放"}, {"weight": 1.6888650460654222, "source": "心", "target": "志"}, {"weight": 0.7080357930536959, "source": "心", "target": "失"}, {"weight": 1.4011829736136412, "source": "心", "target": "求"}, {"weight": 0.9957178655054768, "source": "心", "target": "思"}, {"weight": 0.48489224173948625, "source": "心", "target": "貴"}, {"weight": 2.3174737054877963, "source": "悅", "target": "長"}, {"weight": 2.6